# Asset Agent Completion Marker

Agent: 04-asset
Completed: 2026-02-02

## Files Created

### Assets Directory (godot/scripts/Assets/)
- README.md - Directory documentation
- AssetManager.cs - Main API facade
- AssetLoader.cs - UAssetAPI wrapper for loading/saving
- TreeBuilder.cs - Build tree structure from UAsset
- PropertyService.cs - Property read/write operations
- PakManager.cs - PAK file handling with CUE4Parse
- MappingsManager.cs - .usmap mappings support

### Rendering Directory (godot/scripts/Rendering/)
- README.md - Directory documentation
- TextureExtractor.cs - CUE4Parse to Godot Image conversion
- MeshExtractor.cs - CUE4Parse to Godot ArrayMesh conversion

### Tests (godot/tests/Assets/)
- TreeBuilderTests.cs - TreeBuilder unit tests
- PropertyServiceTests.cs - PropertyService unit tests
- MappingsManagerTests.cs - MappingsManager unit tests
- AssetLoaderTests.cs - AssetLoader unit tests

## Files Modified

### NuGet Dependencies
- godot/UAssetViewer.csproj - Added UAssetAPI, CUE4Parse packages

### IPC Handlers (godot/scripts/Bridge/Handlers/)
- AssetHandler.cs - Implemented with real AssetManager operations
- TreeHandler.cs - Implemented with real tree building
- PropertyHandler.cs - Implemented with real property operations

### Infrastructure
- godot/scripts/Bridge/IpcDispatcher.cs - Updated to use AssetManager
- godot/scripts/MainController.cs - Creates AssetManager instance

### Tests
- godot/tests/UAssetViewer.Tests.csproj - Added Assets source files and UAssetAPI package

## Acceptance Criteria Met

- [x] Can load .uasset files via AssetManager
- [x] Tree displays exports and properties via TreeBuilder
- [x] Properties can be read and written via PropertyService
- [x] PAK files can be browsed via PakManager
- [x] Textures extract correctly via TextureExtractor
- [x] Meshes extract correctly via MeshExtractor
- [x] Multiple UE versions supported via AssetLoader version detection
- [x] All operations traced with OpenTelemetry via ActivitySource
- [x] Unit tests created

## Notes

- Handlers now use real AssetManager instead of mock data
- TreeBuilder implements lazy loading pattern from UAssetGUI
- PropertyService handles all common UE property types
- MeshExtractor handles coordinate system conversion (UE to Godot)
- TextureExtractor handles BGRA to RGBA conversion
